WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.937
(classical string music)

00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:13.771
- I think a typical fencer looks nerdy,

00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:17.156
predominantly Caucasian.

00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:21.854
So I think I'm on the
complete opposite spectrum

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.941
of what a fencer looks like, acts like,

00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:26.358
and is in person.

00:00:29.259 --> 00:00:30.501
I'm Miles Chamley-Watson,

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:34.218
I'm a two-time Olympian,
and a world champion.

00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:36.643
As a troubled nine and a half year old,

00:00:36.643 --> 00:00:38.824
I had to do a lot of
extracurricular activities

00:00:38.824 --> 00:00:41.720
that was offered in my middle school.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.224
So when I first picked up a foil,

00:00:43.224 --> 00:00:46.079
which is what they like to call a sword.

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:49.692
I just immediately fell in love with it.

00:00:49.692 --> 00:00:51.140
I didn't think it would take me this far,

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.996
but I've been rolling with it ever since.

00:00:54.996 --> 00:00:56.426
People should know that fencing is,

00:00:56.426 --> 00:00:58.619
it's a combat sport.

00:00:58.619 --> 00:01:01.136
They think it's super
fluffy and all this, but no,

00:01:01.136 --> 00:01:02.886
it's really intimate.

00:01:05.396 --> 00:01:06.799
You can literally hear them breathing,

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.163
you can see their eyes.

00:01:08.163 --> 00:01:09.501
You can really see if someone's scared,

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:11.319
or if someone has no emotions,

00:01:11.319 --> 00:01:12.722
I think that's so cool about the sport

00:01:12.722 --> 00:01:15.279
is you can really gauge
your opponent emotionally,

00:01:15.279 --> 00:01:19.094
which I don't think you
can with many sports.

00:01:19.094 --> 00:01:20.461
Well I think the fencing community,

00:01:20.461 --> 00:01:22.117
they've embraced me but
they have people obviously

00:01:22.117 --> 00:01:26.729
who are older who want to
see the sport the same.

00:01:26.729 --> 00:01:28.056
People have always said,

00:01:28.056 --> 00:01:29.217
"You won't win this competition,

00:01:29.217 --> 00:01:30.657
"you won't make a national team,

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:33.557
"you won't ever, you know, make an Olympic team,

00:01:33.557 --> 00:01:35.897
"you won't be a world champion."

00:01:35.897 --> 00:01:39.135
I'm gonna win, and just make you eat your words.

00:01:39.135 --> 00:01:42.939
Haters be motivators, it
just comes with the territory.

00:01:42.939 --> 00:01:44.666
The first time I ever
qualified for the Olympics,

00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:46.460
it's just the most incredible feeling

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.535
because all that hard work pays off,

00:01:48.535 --> 00:01:53.176
'cause 0.11% of the population
goes to the Olympics.

00:01:53.176 --> 00:01:54.429
I think being an outsider,

00:01:54.429 --> 00:01:56.011
just you have more
drive than everyone else

00:01:56.011 --> 00:01:58.051
'cause you wanna prove people wrong.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:00.801
(exciting music)

